=2 Walkthrough
* Solo mission.
* Speak with {n:Mariette} at (G-9) in {z:Bastok Markets (S)} to receive a {i:Fiendtrapper|Fiendtrapper|19204} and 5 {i:Blank fiend plates|Blank F. Plate|19205}.
* Use the Fiendtrapper to take pictures of different {p:Quadav|Category:Quadav}.
** {p:Campaign Battle|Category:Campaign Battle} mobs are valid.
** Picture must be taken from the front of the mob, she will not accept pictures from the back or side of the mob.
** The {i:Fiendtrapper|Fiendtrapper|19204} will not work if you are under the effect of {s:Sneak} or {p:Invisible (Status)} or too far away.
* Each picture you take will create a {i:Fiend Plate|Fiend Plate|2560} with the mob's name on it and take up an inventory slot. The exposed {i:Fiend Plates|Fiend Plate|2560} do not stack.
* Return to {n:Mariette} and trade one {i:Fiend Plate|Fiend Plate|2560} at a time.
** After 3 {i:Fiend Plates|Fiend Plate|2560} are accepted, the mission is complete.
** If you have {i:Fiend Plates|Fiend Plate|2560} which were rejected, they might be good enough for {p:Deep Cover I (B)} or {p:Deep Cover II (B)}.

